 be taken seriously. If you think you suffer one of those, reach for help. I mean it.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Hephep Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398180/header.jpg?t=1741255818","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> A rather late Linux version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core (i3)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 (DirectX\u00ae 10) compliant graphics card and driver<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3398180/812392/49adc9f81959a52c53b239e4bb3690691f1dfc7b/1750847311/dash_av1.mpd?t=1736847116","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3398180/812392/49adc9f81959a52c53b239e4bb3690691f1dfc7b/1750847311/dash_h264.mpd?t=1736847116","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3398180/812392/49adc9f81959a52c53b239e4bb3690691f1dfc7b/1750847311/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1736847116","id":257088831,"name":"Hephep Fever Retold gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088831/a7dc8e0e0821a98e3aeaa8ec477ec5736bb197e1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1736847116"}],"name":"Hephep Fever : Retold","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_te